  ('b9cde8d4-09ae-4ede-8c8a-950528a1a646'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000303'::uuid, 'OH', 'commercial', '99341', 'prior_auth_required', '{"answer":"Depends on network status and diagnosis. OUT-OF-NETWORK: prior authorization is required for all out-of-network services except emergency services, so a non-participating practice must obtain it before the visit. MENTAL HEALTH / SUBSTANCE USE DISORDER: no prior authorization is required for evaluation and management visits for a mental health or substance use disorder diagnosis, and the guide extends this explicitly to home and prolonged visits. ANTHEM SECONDARY: no prior authorization is required when Anthem is the secondary payer. SCOPE — the guide''s \"Home-based services\" prior-authorization entries cover home healthcare (physical, occupational and speech therapy), skilled nursing after 18 combined visits, home health aide services, home infusion and private duty nursing. Those are home health agency benefits; the guide states no prior-authorization requirement for a physician home-visit E/M service, and none of those entries should be read as governing this code. Because the guide is a summary, an in-network physical-health visit is not affirmatively cleared here — it is simply not listed.","appliesToService":"All out-of-network services, excluding emergency services — from the list of physical health services that require prior authorization","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code","sourceDocument":"Anthem BCBS Ohio — Quick guide to services requiring prior authorization (Medicaid / MyCare, 1 March 2026)","supportingQuotes":[{"label":"mental health / SUD E/M exemption, incl. home and prolonged visits","quote":"Evaluation and management visits for mental health and substance use disorder, including home and prolonged visits","document":"Anthem BCBS Ohio — Quick guide to services requiring prior authorization (Medicaid / MyCare, 1 March 2026)"},{"label":"Anthem as secondary payer","quote":"Prior authorization is not required when Anthem is the secondary payer.","document":"Anthem BCBS Ohio — Quick guide to services requiring prior authorization (Medicaid / MyCare, 1 March 2026)"},{"label":"home-based services entry — home health agency scope, not physician E/M","quote":"Home healthcare (physical, occupational, and speech therapy) and skilled nursing (after 18 combined visits, regardless of modality)","document":"Anthem BCBS Ohio — Quick guide to services requiring prior authorization (Medicaid / MyCare, 1 March 2026)"}]}'::jsonb, 'varies', 0.80, DATE '2026-03-01', NULL, 'c1a1d3f2-6b74-4b8e-9a21-7c5e2f4d8a04'::uuid, 'All out-of-network services, excluding emergency services', 'extract:denial-rules-round2-2026-08'),
