  ('b568d8a1-e4bf-47e0-8418-65d24b8f00e6'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000303'::uuid, 'OH', 'commercial', '99499', 'prior_auth_required', '{"answer":"Yes. Prior authorization is required for unlisted, miscellaneous and manually priced codes, expressly including codes ending in 99. 99499 (unlisted evaluation and management service) is exactly that, so it must be authorised before the service is billed. Two exceptions from the same guide: no prior authorization is required when Anthem is the secondary payer, and out-of-network services already require prior authorization in every case except emergencies.","appliesToService":"All unlisted miscellaneous and manually priced codes (including but not limited to codes ending in 99)","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code","sourceDocument":"Anthem BCBS Ohio — Quick guide to services requiring prior authorization (Medicaid / MyCare, 1 March 2026)","supportingQuotes":[{"label":"Anthem as secondary payer","quote":"Prior authorization is not required when Anthem is the secondary payer.","document":"Anthem BCBS Ohio — Quick guide to services requiring prior authorization (Medicaid / MyCare, 1 March 2026)"},{"label":"out-of-network services","quote":"All out-of-network services, excluding emergency services","document":"Anthem BCBS Ohio — Quick guide to services requiring prior authorization (Medicaid / MyCare, 1 March 2026)"}]}'::jsonb, 'varies', 0.85, DATE '2026-03-01', NULL, 'c1a1d3f2-6b74-4b8e-9a21-7c5e2f4d8a04'::uuid, 'All unlisted miscellaneous and manually priced codes (including but not limited to codes ending in 99)', 'extract:denial-rules-round2-2026-08')
